Hello, First of all, if it matters, I have used your slideshow already a while and it is working so great, that I also purchased it. I have thought about one new option, which would make it even better. Would it be possible to have toolbar button with function "show full sized image"? I mean that it would pause the slideshow, show fullsized image, and when browser back is pressed, it would continue the slideshow. Right now I have in some cases a problem with image resizing, if image is too big, browser resizes it smaller so, that you can see sawtooth on all curves. Having a possibility to show fullsized image in same browser window would help with this. Please let me know your thoughts, Best regards, Janne Laaksonen http://www.kuvaajanne.fi